// Suppresses Terminus's own side bar entry.
//
// Terminus ships a one-line Side Bar.sublime-menu declaring "Open Terminus
// here...". Package menus can only append, so its position is Sublime's to
// choose, not ours — and the frequency order in Default/Side Bar.sublime-menu
// needs it in the tools group at the bottom. So the entry is declared there
// instead, and this empty override stops the packaged one drawing twice.
//
// A loose file under Packages/<Name>/ shadows the same path inside
// <Name>.sublime-package. Only this one file is replaced; Terminus's plugins,
// commands and settings still load from the package as normal.
//
// Frozen against Terminus as of 2026-08-15. If a later version adds entries
// here, they won't appear until this file is re-synced:
//   unzip -p "$HOME/.config/sublime-text/Installed Packages/Terminus.sublime-package" \
//     "Side Bar.sublime-menu"
[]
